  "caption": "Instrumental original handheld JRPG underwater cue in B major, 4/4, 74 quarter-note BPM. Preserve the complete supplied 12-bar independent melody, varied phrase rests, explicit scene-specific support and bass. piano lead with vibraphone support. Clean restrained timbres, no extra notes or reharmonization, no distortion, vocals or fade.",
